Steps To Reproduce
	1.	Create a component with nested <Suspense> boundaries:
	•	Parent <Suspense> wraps a parent component (DataParent) with a fallback.
	•	Child <Suspense> wraps a child component (DataChild) with its own fallback.
	2.	Pass data-fetching promises to both parent and child components using React.use() or async/await to simulate Suspense-compatible data fetching.
	3.	Ensure the child <Suspense> fallback is rendered only when the parent data is resolved but the child data is still loading.

Here’s a sample implementation:

```
"use client";

